APACHE OPENSERVERLESS SUBCOMPONENTS

The Apache OpenServerless (Incubating) OpenWhisk convenience binaries -- the
container images built from Apache OpenWhisk with the OpenServerless patches
(openwhisk-patch): the scala base image and the controller, invoker,
scheduler and standalone images derived from it -- include a number of
subcomponents with separate copyright notices and license terms. Your use of
these subcomponents is subject to the terms and conditions of the following
licenses.


